Foosball (table soccer) tables are classified in heading 9504 as articles for arcade, table or parlor games. Subheading 9504.90 covers "other" games, and 9504.90.40 covers "Table games and parts and accessories thereof". The statistical suffix for 9504.90.4000 is 9504.90.4000, as it has no further breakdown. Earlier CBP rulings on foosball tables classified them in 9504.90.4000. Heading 9504.30 covers coin- or disc-operated games, which does not apply here since the table has no coin mechanism.

Note that the HTSUS has a subheading 9504.90.40 for "Table games and parts and accessories thereof", and CBP rulings on foosball tables, including those with electronic scoring, use 9504.90.4000.

{"hts_code": "9504.90.4000", "reason": "A foosball table with electronic scoring and no coin-operated mechanism is a table game of heading 9504, classified under subheading 9504.90.40 as table games and parts and accessories thereof."}
